            "summarizeBy": "none",
            "description": "Product 1 of up to 5 — whether the product is covered by a federal health programme. ~5-7% NULL. CMS models a one-to-many product list as five repeated column groups; the sparsity of the tail members is the surface this dataset was added to measure."
          },
